{"unit_id":"JuneLearn__dsh-reasoning-settings#feature-reasoning-levels","repo":"JuneLearn/dsh-reasoning-settings","commit":"25b6ee69fe717414cd1c6f3b1c39b5e62a8e99c9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Reasoning Settings 的功能「模型推理档位」：在设置卡片中为每个自定义模型选择继承、禁用或自定义模式，并勾选可用强度。可为启用档位编辑传输值，再保存到 Provider 配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:228-293","lib/client.js:349-399"]}
{"unit_id":"JuneLearn__dsh-reasoning-settings#feature-provider-default","repo":"JuneLearn/dsh-reasoning-settings","commit":"25b6ee69fe717414cd1c6f3b1c39b5e62a8e99c9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Reasoning Settings 的功能「Provider 默认强度」：按 Provider 选择默认推理强度，选项限于该 Provider 所有模型共同支持的档位。用户修改后点击保存，设置写入 llm-pi-ai 配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:156-188","lib/client.js:415-476"]}
{"unit_id":"JuneLearn__dsh-reasoning-settings#feature-thinking-format","repo":"JuneLearn/dsh-reasoning-settings","commit":"25b6ee69fe717414cd1c6f3b1c39b5e62a8e99c9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Reasoning Settings 的功能「推理格式」：当 Provider 使用 openai-completions 时，可设置其推理参数格式或选择自动检测。保存时将该格式更新到 Provider 的 compat 配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:366-370","lib/client.js:447-459"]}
{"unit_id":"JuneLearn__dsh-reasoning-settings#feature-subagent-routing","repo":"JuneLearn/dsh-reasoning-settings","commit":"25b6ee69fe717414cd1c6f3b1c39b5e62a8e99c9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Reasoning Settings 的功能「子 Agent 路由」：扩展 subagent 工具参数，可按次指定已配置的 Provider、模型与推理强度；Provider 和模型须同时提供。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:156-183","lib/index.js:252-269"]}
{"unit_id":"JuneLearn__dsh-reasoning-settings#feature-inheritance","repo":"JuneLearn/dsh-reasoning-settings","commit":"25b6ee69fe717414cd1c6f3b1c39b5e62a8e99c9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Reasoning Settings 的功能「子 Agent 模型继承」：创建进程内子 Agent 请求时，读取父会话当前路由；没有显式子路由时继承父模型，并在相同目标路由时继承父级推理强度。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:196-242","lib/index.js:338-388"]}
